## Injects — drop these in to steer & stimulate discussion

| When | Inject (read aloud) | Purpose — what it forces |
|---|---|---|
| ~T+15 | "A key enterprise customer emails: *'our data is missing — is this a breach?'*" | Customer-comms ownership, decision authority, and breach assessment (steer them to **confirm it is NOT a breach** — human error, no exfiltration). |
| ~T+30 | "The first restore is slower than expected — full restore ETA ~3–4 hours." | RTO awareness (12h target — are we inside it?), how we operate while down, status-update cadence. |
| ~T+45 | "Someone asks: *how much data did we actually lose?*" | RPO understanding (24h target; ~12h actual loss → acceptable) and reconciliation of the lost ~12h of transactions. |

