## Why this scenario (validity note)
Covers **both** disciplines the evidence must show:
- **DR** — backup **restoration** (the BC/DR plan mandates the annual test *include* a backup-restoration test), data-integrity verification, RTO/RPO.
- **BC** — decision authority, internal + customer comms, operating during downtime.

Anchored to the real plan (Azure primary, OVHCloud failover, Slack comms, Appendix B RTO/RPO), so the resulting record validates documented procedures — exactly what an auditor checks.
